    "type": "game",
    "name": "Word Relay",
    "steam_appid": 2673020,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2673020/extras/a8ce44a8fbe8a25b770f4750dd94a027.webp?t=1750089903\" width=616 height=50 /></span><br>READ, REMEMBER, and WRITE words in a sequence, adhering to a simple rule: the word must begin with the same letter that the previous word ended with. A competitive word battle. <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2673020/extras/3bcf532496b2ec149e084edd176d0117.poster.avif?t=1750089903\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2673020/extras/3bcf532496b2ec149e084edd176d0117.gif?t=1750089903\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></span><br><br>Strategically build your list of words, strive for the longest ones, try getting bonus points, and remember opponents' words, which you can cleverly incorporate into future games. <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2673020/extras/7371a66bd70ce5d13e789123f8ea2f64.poster.avif?t=1750089903\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2673020/extras/7371a66bd70ce5d13e789123f8ea2f64.webp?t=1750089903\" class=\"bb_img\" width=616 height=50 /></picture></span><br><br>Scores are determined by evaluating several factors, including the quantity of legitimate words played, the length of each word, and any unsuccessful attempts made during a player's turn. <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2673020/extras/ce3e32cd69e0a0e08f728c1843b0fb9c.poster.avif?t=1750089903\" width=616 height=72 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2673020/extras/ce3e32cd69e0a0e08f728c1843b0fb9c.webm?t=1750089903\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br><br>Whether you prefer solo play for practicing English words or competing against friends, Word Relay offers an exciting gaming experience. <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2673020/extras/516bff7bd45787078b169794b6d6eba4.poster.avif?t=1750089903\" width=616 height=100 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2673020/extras/516bff7bd45787078b169794b6d6eba4.webm?t=1750089903\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Features</h2><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Unique games with changing bonus rules<br></li><li> Weekly quest to build vocabulary<br></li><li> Customizable games to play how you want<br></li><li> Attack or defend with strategic wordplay<br></li><li> Opportunity to learn new words within each game</li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2673020/extras/a8ce44a8fbe8a25b770f4750dd94a027.webp?t=1750089903\" width=616 height=50 /></span><br>READ, REMEMBER, and WRITE words in a sequence, adhering to a simple rule: the word must begin with the same letter that the previous word ended with. A competitive word battle. <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2673020/extras/3bcf532496b2ec149e084edd176d0117.poster.avif?t=1750089903\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2673020/extras/3bcf532496b2ec149e084edd176d0117.gif?t=1750089903\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></span><br><br>Strategically build your list of words, strive for the longest ones, try getting bonus points, and remember opponents' words, which you can cleverly incorporate into future games. <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2673020/extras/7371a66bd70ce5d13e789123f8ea2f64.poster.avif?t=1750089903\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2673020/extras/7371a66bd70ce5d13e789123f8ea2f64.webp?t=1750089903\" class=\"bb_img\" width=616 height=50 /></picture></span><br><br>Scores are determined by evaluating several factors, including the quantity of legitimate words played, the length of each word, and any unsuccessful attempts made during a player's turn. <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2673020/extras/ce3e32cd69e0a0e08f728c1843b0fb9c.poster.avif?t=1750089903\" width=616 height=72 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2673020/extras/ce3e32cd69e0a0e08f728c1843b0fb9c.webm?t=1750089903\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br><br>Whether you prefer solo play for practicing English words or competing against friends, Word Relay offers an exciting gaming experience. <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2673020/extras/516bff7bd45787078b169794b6d6eba4.poster.avif?t=1750089903\" width=616 height=100 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2673020/extras/516bff7bd45787078b169794b6d6eba4.webm?t=1750089903\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Features</h2><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Unique games with changing bonus rules<br></li><li> Weekly quest to build vocabulary<br></li><li> Customizable games to play how you want<br></li><li> Attack or defend with strategic wordplay<br></li><li> Opportunity to learn new words within each game</li></ul>",
    "short_description": "Read, Remember and Write! Read what others write. Remember because you cannot reuse words. Write a word on your turn that starts with the previous word's ending letter. Outsmart your opponents using bonus rules. Watch out, time is running short!",
    "supported_languages": "English, Italian, German, Japanese, Korean, Polish, Spanish - Latin America, Simplified Chinese, Russian, Traditional Chinese",
